TITLE:: InsightImagerView
summary:: the stereo pane of an Insight window
categories:: Libraries>Insight
related:: Classes/Insight, Classes/InsightPanel

DESCRIPTION::
The goniometer - one point a sample, mid up and side across, on a square root scale; the hard-left and hard-right diagonals dashed; clipped samples red - with the correlation as a bar from 0 (the half under 0, where the channels cancel, outlined), the balance under it and the width. One channel: it says there is no image.

A UserView the link::Classes/InsightPanel:: puts in a titled pane. It reads the insight and draws what it finds; the panel's updater calls refresh.

table::
## strong::hover:: || the hint strip says what the scope, the correlation or the balance shows
::

